# ShadowTrain Viewer

ESP32-S3 based network image viewer for ShadowTrain.

## Hardware

- Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-4.3B
- 800x480 RGB LCD
- 8 MB PSRAM
- ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8

## Current Features

- RGB framebuffer
- Graphics library
- Bitmap font rendering
- PNG asset conversion
- Splash screen
- Wi-Fi connectivity
- IP address display

## Planned Features

- HTTP server
- JPEG decoding
- Image streaming from Jetson Orin Nano
- Touch interface

## Build

Copy:

include/Config.example.h

to

include/Config.h

and enter your Wi-Fi credentials.

Build with PlatformIO.